          <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Cruise past Cabo's highlights (Arch, sea lions, beaches)</span></li>
          <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Head to the snorkeling area</span></li>
          <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Snorkel with provided gear</span></li>
